        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qaynuunnadii Sabtida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Muuse isu soo ururiyey shirkii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Kuwanu waa erayadii Rabbigu idinku amray inaad yeeshaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lix maalmood waa in la shaqeeyaa, laakiinse maalinta toddobaad waa inay maalin quduus ah idiin ahaataa oo waa sabti nasasho oo Rabbiga loo nasto, oo ku alla kii maalintaas shuqul qabta waa in nafta laga qaadaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalin kasta oo sabti ah waa inaydnaan innaba dab ku shidin rugihiinna oo dhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qalabka Taambuugga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Muuse wuxuu la hadlay shirkii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan, isagoo leh, Waxanu waa wixii Rabbigu idinku amray, isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idinku dhexdiinna waa inaad wax Rabbiga isaga ururisaan. Mid kasta oo qalbigiisu raalli ka yahay, ha keeno qurbaanka Rabbiga, kaasoo ah dahab, iyo lacag, iyo naxaas, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo buluug, iyo guduud, iyo casaan, iyo maro wanaagsan, iyo dhogor riyaad, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo wanan hargahood oo la caseeyey, iyo adhidibadeed hargahood, iyo qori qudhac ah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo saliid laambadda lagu shubo, iyo udgoon lagu daro saliidda lagu subkado, iyo foox udgoon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo dhagaxyo onika la yidhaahdo, iyo dhagaxyo lagu dhejiyo eefodka iyo laabgashiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo nin kasta oo xigmad leh oo idinku dhex jiraaba ha yimaado oo ha sameeyo wixii Rabbigu idinku amray oo dhan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waxaas oo ah taambuugga iyo teendhadiisa, iyo dedkiisa, iyo qabsatooyinkiisa, iyo looxyadiisa, iyo ulihiisa gudban, iyo tiirarkiisa, iyo saldhigyadiisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo sanduuqa, iyo ulihiisa, iyo daboolka, iyo ilxidhka daaha ah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo miiska, iyo ulihiisa, iyo alaabtiisa oo dhan, iyo kibista tusniinta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo laambadda iftiinka aawadiis, iyo alaabteeda, iyo laambadaheeda, iyo saliidda iftiinka aawadiis, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo meesha allabariga ee fooxa, iyo ulaheeda, iyo saliidda lagu subkado, iyo fooxa udgoon, iyo daaha iridda laga soo galo taambuugga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo meesha allabariga lagu gubo, iyo shabaggeeda naxaasta ah, iyo ulaheeda, iyo alaabteeda oo dhan, iyo berkedda weysada, iyo salkeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo barxadda daahyadeeda, iyo tiirarkeeda, iyo saldhigyadooda, iyo daaha iridda barxadda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo musmaarradii taambuugga, iyo musmaarradii barxadda, iyo xadhkahooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo dharka lagaga adeegi lahaa meesha quduuska ah, kuwaas oo ah dharka quduuska ah ee wadaadka Haaruun, iyo dharka wiilashiisa si ay ugaga adeegaan hawsha wadaadnimada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa shirkii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhammu waxay ka tageen Muuse hortiisii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay yimaadeen iyagoo mid walba qalbigiisu kacay, oo mid walba ruuxiisu raalli ka dhigay, oo waxay keeneen waxay Rabbiga u bixiyeen, kuwaasoo ah wixii loo doonay shuqulkii teendhada shirka, iyo hawsheeda oo dhan, iyo dharkii quduuska ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo in alla intii raalliga ahayd way yimaadeen, rag iyo dumarba, oo waxay keeneen dugaagado, iyo hilqado, iyo kaatunno, iyo murriyado, iyo wax kasta oo laysku sharxo oo dahab ah; oo nin kastaaba wuxuu Rabbiga u bixiyey wax dahab ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo nin walba, oo laga helay buluug, iyo guduud, iyo casaan, iyo maro wanaagsan, iyo dhogor riyaad, iyo wanan hargahood oo la caseeyey, iyo adhidibadeed hargahoodba wuu keenay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo mid kasta oo qurbaan lacag iyo naxaas ah bixiyey wuxuu u bixiyey Rabbiga; oo nin kasta oo laga helay qori qudhac ah wuxuu u keenay hawsha adeegidda aawadeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dumarkii xigmadda lahaa oo dhammu waxay gacmahooda ku miiqeen dun, oo waxay keeneen wixii ay miiqeen oo ahaa buluug, iyo guduud, iyo casaan, iyo maro wanaagsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dumarkii qalbigoodu xigmadda la kacay oo dhammu waxay miiqeen dhogor riyaad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taliyayaashiina waxay keeneen dhagaxyada onika la yidhaahdo, iyo dhagaxyada lagu dhejiyo eefodka iyo laabgashiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxayna keeneen uunsiga, iyo saliidda iftiinka, iyo saliidda lagu subkado, iyo fooxa udgoon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer binu Israa'iil waxay Rabbiga u bixiyeen qurbaan ay raalli ka yihiin; oo waxay ahaayeen dad rag iyo dumarba leh oo qalbigoodu raalli ka ahaa inay u keenaan shuqulka Rabbigu Muuse ku amray in la sameeyo oo dhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
